 "description": "Anonymous, non-mutating Wikidot edit/PagePreviewModule observations on scp-wiki (2026-10-19) of how inline raw `@@` pairs and where `[[module CSS]]` is recognized. Each record is a sealed wikidot_syntax_differential.wikidot_reference.v1 record (source, provenance, raw_html, sha256).",
 "rules_established": [
  "Inline raw `@@ ... @@` pairs only within one physical line: a lone `@@` (plain or inside {{ }}) is literal; `@@` on different lines or paragraphs never pair.",
  "`[[module CSS]]` is recognized only at the start of a line (leading spaces allowed); mid-line, including inside {{ }}, it is plain text and consumes nothing."
 ],
